6
00:00:22,972 --> 00:00:26,410
The entry did its quiet job: it kept us out.

7
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:31,345
Why we grade in public: a forecast that is never checked is just content.

8
00:00:31,345 --> 00:00:36,754
Every morning call gets an evening verdict, and both go in the permanent record.

9
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:40,330
On the day, the book is down 535 dollars.

10
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,325
Chevron (CVX) leads, +2.9 percent.

11
00:00:43,325 --> 00:00:45,703
