22
00:01:44,584 --> 00:01:46,370
Worst, LLY at -2.54.

23
00:01:46,370 --> 00:01:51,551
Both go in the journal — wins and losses get the same ink.

24
00:01:51,551 --> 00:01:59,053
The honest scoreboard reads: expectancy -3.13% per trade over 1201 graded positions.

25
00:01:59,053 --> 00:02:06,376
Because that record is soft, the system has throttled itself to 25% position size.

26
00:02:06,376 --> 00:02:11,735
